        <profile id="dr-inescapable" name="Inescapable Accuracy" hidden="false" typeId="ability-11e0" typeName="Abilities"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="description-11e0">Each time a model in this unit makes a ranged attack, you can ignore any or all modifiers to that attack’s Ballistic Skill characteristic and any or all modifiers to the Hit roll.</characteristic></characteristics></profile>
        <profile id="dr-shrine" name="Aspect Shrine Token" hidden="false" typeId="ability-11e0" typeName="Abilities"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="description-11e0">Once per battle for each Aspect Shrine token this unit has, change one Hit roll or one Wound roll made for a model in this unit (excluding Character models) to an unmodified 6.</characteristic></characteristics></profile>
