 name="A" typeId="fd-ma">3</characteristic><characteristic name="WS" typeId="fd-mws">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="S" typeId="fd-ms">6</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="fd-map">0</characteristic><characteristic name="D" typeId="fd-md">1</characteristic></characteristics><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="false"><conditions><condition type="atLeast" value="2" field="selections" scope="parent" childId="smoke-605-model-0" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/></conditions></modifier></modifiers></profile><profile id="smoke-605-ability-rule-harassment-fire" name="Harassment Fire" hidden="false" typeId="ability-11e0" typeName="Abilities"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="description-11e0">In your Shooting phase, after this unit has shot, select one enemy unit hit by one or more of those attacks. Until the start of your next turn, that enemy unit is suppressed. While a unit is suppressed, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, subtract 1 from the Hit roll.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="smoke-605-keywords" name="Keywords" hidden="false" typeId="keywords-11e0" typeName="Keywords"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="unit-keywords-11e0">Vypers, Fly, Vehicle, Aeldari</characteristic><characteristic name="Faction Keywords" typeId="faction-keywords-11e0">Asuryani, Ynnari</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><rules><rule id="smoke-605-rule-deadly-demise-d3" name="Deadly Demise D3" hidden="false"><description>Each time this model is destroyed, after embarked units (if any) have made emergency disembark moves, roll one D6. On a 6, each unit within 6&quot; suffers D3 mortal wounds.</description></rule><rule id="smoke-605-rule-battle-focus-faction-" name="Battle Focus (Faction)" hidden="false"><description>If your Army Faction is Asuryani, at the start of each battle round you receive Battle Focus tokens: Incursion 2, Strike Force 4, Onslaught 6. Spend tokens to enable eligible Agile Manoeuvres; unused tokens expire at the end of the battle round. Consult the full faction rule for manoeuvre triggers and effects.</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="smoke-category-605" name="Vehicle" targetId="smoke-cat-6" primary="true" hidden="false"/></categoryLinks><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="mul-605-main" name="1. Main Weapon" hidden="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="mul-605-main-bright"><constraints><constraint id="mul-605-main-min" type="min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/><constraint id="mul-605-main-max" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/></constraints><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="mul-605-main-min" value="2"><conditions><condition type="atLeast" value="2" field="selections" scope="parent" childId="smoke-605-model-0" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/></conditions></modifier><modifier type="set" field="mul-605-main-max" value="2"><conditions><condition type="atLeast" value="2" field="selections" scope="parent" childId="smoke-605-model-0" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/></conditions></modifier></modifiers><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="mul-605-main-bright" name="Bright lance" hidden="false" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint id="mul-605-main-bright-min" type="min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/><constraint id="mul-605-main-bright-max" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="2" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/></constraints></selectionEntry><se