"><characteristics><characteristic name="Range" typeId="fd-mrng">Melee</characteristic><characteristic name="A" typeId="fd-ma">3</characteristic><characteristic name="WS" typeId="fd-mws">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="S" typeId="fd-ms">6</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="fd-map">0</characteristic><characteristic name="D" typeId="fd-md">1</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="smoke-599-ability-wave-serpent-shield" name="Wave Serpent Shield" hidden="false" typeId="ability-11e0" typeName="Abilities"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="description-11e0">Each time a ranged attack targets this model, if the Strength characteristic of that attack is greater than the Toughness characteristic of this model, subtract 1 from the Wound roll.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="smoke-599-keywords" name="Keywords" hidden="false" typeId="keywords-11e0" typeName="Keywords"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="unit-keywords-11e0">Wave Serpent, Frame, Vehicle, Aeldari, Transport, Dedicated Transport, Fly</characteristic><characteristic name="Faction Keywords" typeId="faction-keywords-11e0">Asuryani, Ynnari</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><rules><rule id="smoke-599-rule-deadly-demise-d3" name="Deadly Demise D3" hidden="false"><description>Each time this model is destroyed, after embarked units (if any) have made emergency disembark moves, roll one D6. On a 6, each unit within 6&quot; suffers D3 mortal wounds.</description></rule><rule id="smoke-599-rule-battle-focus-faction-" name="Battle Focus (Faction)" hidden="false"><description>If your Army Faction is Asuryani, at the start of each battle round you receive Battle Focus tokens: Incursion 2, Strike Force 4, Onslaught 6. Spend tokens to enable eligible Agile Manoeuvres; unused tokens expire at the end of the battle round. Consult the full faction rule for manoeuvre triggers and effects.</description></